
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Outreach | Rafael Bertolotto Stefanelli</title>

    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #e8e8e8;
        background: #1a1a1a;
      }

      nav {
        background: #222222;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #3a3a3a;
        padding: 15px 30px;
      }

      nav .nav-container {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      nav .name {
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      nav a {
        color: #cccccc;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-left: 20px;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      main {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 70px 30px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #3a3a3a;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #ffffff;
        margin-top: 40px;
      }

      a {
        color: #82b1ff;
      }

      .outreach-item {
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .outreach-photo {
        max-width: 100%;
        width: 500px;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-top: 15px;
      }

      footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 30px;
        color: #888888;
        border-top: 1px solid #3a3a3a;
        margin-top: 80px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        nav .nav-container {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 10px;
        }

        nav a {
          margin: 0 8px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <!-- Shared navigation bar -->
    <div id="navbar"></div>

    <main>
      <h1>Science Outreach</h1>

      <p>
        I am passionate about sharing astronomy and science
        with the broader community. Through outreach activities,
        public talks, and educational events, I aim to make
        astrophysics accessible to people of all ages and
        backgrounds.
      </p>

      <h2>Outreach Activities</h2>

      <div class="outreach-item">
        <h3>Activity Title</h3>

        <p>
          <strong>Location:</strong> Institution or city<br>
          <strong>Date:</strong> Month, Year
        </p>

        <p>
          Description of the outreach activity, including
          its goals, audience, and your participation.
        </p>

        <!-- Optional photograph
        <img
          src="images/outreach1.jpg"
          alt="Description of outreach activity"
          class="outreach-photo"
        >
        -->
      </div>

      <h2>Public Talks and Presentations</h2>

      <div class="outreach-item">
        <h3>Talk Title</h3>

        <p>
          <strong>Event:</strong> Event name<br>
          <strong>Date:</strong> Month, Year
        </p>

        <p>
          Brief description of the talk and its audience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>Educational Resources</h2>

      <p>
        Here you can share educational materials,
        presentations, videos, or other resources
        related to astronomy and astrophysics.
      </p>
    </main>

    <footer>
      © 2026 Rafael Bertolotto Stefanelli
    </footer>

    <script src="navbar.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
